<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sale.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Christchurch was 440 NZ cents per kg clean versus 444 at the last sales on February 20, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 911 vs 870</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 549 vs 534</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 378 vs 388</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 386 vs 395</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
